An unknown identity remains a gap and blocks a contradictory validity claim.\",\"verification_subject\":\"EPS engineering framework implementation\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_source_locator\":\"/tmp/eps-oosem.wmUVTQ/final_report/traceability/framework-baseline.json#verification_cases row FR-09\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Full raw-result capture and applicable configuration-item completeness checks are absent.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Registration and technical validity remain separate. Unknown producer/configuration identity blocks an unqualified validity claim.\",\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-02\",\"MN-05\",\"MN-09\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-02\",\"MR-05\",\"MR-09\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"COM-H03\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"COM-H03\"],\"procedure_performers\":{\"COM-P04\":[\"Framework maintainer\",\"Designated domain reviewer\"]}}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
