sing part data is reported.\",\"verification_subject\":\"EPS engineering framework implementation\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_source_locator\":\"/tmp/eps-oosem.wmUVTQ/final_report/traceability/framework-baseline.json#verification_cases row FR-12\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Quantity/assembly traversal and revision-linked BOM formula/query profile need development.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"Catalogue definitions differ from design occurrences. EPS engineer accepts selected parts and quantities.\",\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-03\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-03\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"COM-H01\",\"COM-H02\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"COM-H01\",\"COM-H02\",\"COM-H03\"],\"procedure_performers\":{\"COM-P02\":[\"EPS engineer\",\"Project manager\"]}}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
