-0876/review-report-0876.md\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[5],\"section\":\"first 4.2.1\",\"source_maturity\":\"Reported native capability\",\"allocation_evidence_role\":\"native template/category pattern plus transferable CSRM\"},{\"evidence_id\":\"COM-E09\",\"source_id\":\"citation-2362\",\"source_path\":\"SLR/SLR1/pdfs/citation-reports/citation-report-2362/citation-report-2362.md\",\"physical_pdf_pages\":[2,4,5],\"section\":\"CSRM, CSRM Application, Mission-specific CubeSat Model, Transition\",\"source_maturity\":\"Reference model guidance\",\"allocation_evidence_role\":\"native template/category pattern plus transferable CSRM\"}],\"verification_id\":\"V15\",\"verification_method\":\"I,D\",\"verification_fixture_observation\":\"Instantiate the representation in two contrasting cases and trace a requirement through function, allocation, interface and analysis. An extension retains its relation to the generic core.\",\"verification_subject\":\"EPS engineering framework implementation\",\"verification_status\":\"planned, not executed\",\"verification_source_locator\":\"/tmp/eps-oosem.wmUVTQ/final_report/traceability/framework-baseline.json#verification_cases row FR-15\",\"implementation_gap\":\"Generic EPS behavior, full allocations/interfaces and extension checks are not delivered by the reported hardware-category bridge.\",\"boundary_authority_note\":\"COMET remains the study center. Companion fields extend its schema under one field-authority map.\",\"mission_need_ids\":[\"MN-04\",\"MN-11\"],\"mission_requirement_ids\":[\"MR-04\",\"MR-11\"],\"execution_host_ids\":[\"COM-H01\",\"COM-H02\",\"COM-H03\"],\"storage_host_ids\":[\"COM-H02\",\"COM-H03\"],\"procedure_performers\":{\"COM-P01\":[\"Systems engineer\",\"Participant acting in declared engineering role\"]}}"; status = "proposed comparison description, not implemented or verified"; }
